cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this replication package, please cite it using the metadata below.
  Please also cite the article it accompanies.
title: >-
  Replication package for "Oil Price Shocks, Fiscal Balance, and Public
  Investment in Ecuador, 2015-2025"
abstract: >-
  Data and R Markdown code reproducing every table, figure and statistic
  reported in the article. Contains the monthly analysis dataset for Ecuador
  (January 2015 - November 2025) covering WTI crude oil prices and Non-Financial
  Public Sector investment and fiscal balance, the complete analysis document
  (VAR, impulse response functions, forecast error variance decomposition, and
  symmetric and asymmetric Local Projections with Newey-West HAC standard
  errors), and the source document backing the reported oil-revenue share.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jiménez-Albán
    given-names: Xavier
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7227-9392
    affiliation: Independent Researcher, Quito, Ecuador
  - family-names: Urquiza-Aguiar
    given-names: Luis
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6405-2067
    affiliation: >-
      Carrera de Software, Facultad de Ingeniería y Ciencias Aplicadas,
      Universidad de las Américas (UDLA), Quito, Ecuador
keywords:
  - oil price shocks
  - fiscal balance
  - public investment
  - Ecuador
  - vector autoregression
  - local projections
  - dollarization
  - reproducibility
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0

